# Track only the LaTeX source. Everything else stays local: build
# artifacts (PDF, .aux, .log, .toc, ...), working notes, correspondence
# drafts, editor and tooling config, the Makefile, and the title-page logo.
#
# Note: this ignores subdirectories wholesale, so a .tex file added under
# one would need an explicit exception here.
*
!/.gitignore
!*.tex
